Comment:
 This package selectively ports the six authorized qvr-nonraid implementation
 commits through 73cc390 and drill evidence through 4ad16c5 from prototype pin
 1eca6fcaaeedfc64469e0746fe8a120c1dcb3675. It is a separate process/package
 boundary and does not relicense the GPL-2.0-only NonRAID kernel driver or
 tools packages.

